{"3741900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ghoul Thrasher", "steam_appid": 3741900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghoul Thrasher is a dismal dark fantasy dungeon crawler. An 8-bit, retro, roguelike quest through a decrepit dungeon, deep and dangerous. Survive the corrupted Citadel Sinystera, battling through randomly generated rooms, riddled with horrifying monsters and deadly traps. Step into the soggy greaves of Gnargoth, a humble peasant with nothing to lose and everything to fight for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghoul Thrasher is an old-school, tabletop inspired solo-rpg, your journey depends upon the dice, crits and failures will determine your fate. It is packed with brutal 8-bit pixel art, inspired by retro horror and table top fantasy. Featuring guest art from master of psychedelic horror, SKINNER.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through 6 levels of ghouls, beasts, cultists, traps, gamblers, alchemists, and oddities before taking on the final boss, the wretched, repulsive Vermintrilloquist! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock out to the chiptune soundtrack featuring doom metal inspired dirges and spooky square wave synthscapes. And search the dungeon for a special chiptune appearance by fantasy metal band, Castle Rat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Pick up and play' gameplay style, finish a successful run in around 30 minutes. Delve into randomly generated, door bashing adventure, with two difficulty settings and unlimited replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the Citadel?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghoul Thrasher is a dismal dark fantasy dungeon crawler. An 8-bit, retro, roguelike quest through a decrepit dungeon, deep and dangerous. Survive the corrupted Citadel Sinystera, battling through randomly generated rooms, riddled with horrifying monsters and deadly traps. Step into the soggy greaves of Gnargoth, a humble peasant with nothing to lose and everything to fight for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghoul Thrasher is an old-school, tabletop inspired solo-rpg, your journey depends upon the dice, crits and failures will determine your fate. It is packed with brutal 8-bit pixel art, inspired by retro horror and table top fantasy. Featuring guest art from master of psychedelic horror, SKINNER.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through 6 levels of ghouls, beasts, cultists, traps, gamblers, alchemists, and oddities before taking on the final boss, the wretched, repulsive Vermintrilloquist! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock out to the chiptune soundtrack featuring doom metal inspired dirges and spooky square wave synthscapes. And search the dungeon for a special chiptune appearance by fantasy metal band, Castle Rat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Pick up and play' gameplay style, finish a successful run in around 30 minutes. Delve into randomly generated, door bashing adventure, with two difficulty settings and unlimited replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the Citadel?</p>", "short_description": "Ghoul Thrasher is dismal dark fantasy dungeon crawler. An 8-bit, retro, roguelike quest through a decrepit dungeon, deep and dangerous. Survive the corrupted Citadel Sinystera, battling through randomly generated rooms, riddled with horrifying monsters and deadly traps.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741900/9ceda06772e4c22f12db7b5d09853af7020e3448/header.jpg?t=1761932010", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741900/e9ed9000c